        "TileImage": "$($repository e02401e2-aeaf-436a-9b48-3133746af4a2).Image",
        "Description": "An irresponsible director.\rA purveyor of questionable &quot;crystal&quot; products.\rA man looking to find out more about death machines.\rAnd... a tech reporter. \r\rDid we mess up on the contract listing somewhere, or? No? \rShe&apos;s supposed to be a target? Okay then. Um.\r\rWell, okay. \r\rUh, the reason you&apos;re going after these three (and the techie, I guess?) is because of their involvement in OSHA violations. And advertisement violations.  We don&apos;t care how you do it. Just make sure it doesn&apos;t come back to us.",
